  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Pick and finely chop rosemary (see ingredients). <br>• Thinly slice potato into rounds. <br>• Place potato rounds on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and rosemary, then toss to coat. <br>• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693119768a52ddcac84ce3eb/step-9bfbf500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, thinly slice onion (see ingredients). Roughly chop tomato. <br>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. <br>• Cook onion and tomato, stirring, until softened, 5-6 mins. Reduce heat to medium. <br>• Add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and water and mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 mins. Transfer to a small bowl.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693119768a52ddcac84ce3eb/step-26120510.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Pat haloumi dry, then slice horizontally to get 1 piece per person.<br>• Wash out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. <br>• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. <br>• Remove from heat, then add the honey, turning to coat.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693119768a52ddcac84ce3eb/step-84266d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, halve continental rolls and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 mins. <br>• Top continental rolls with dill &amp; parsley mayonnaise, tomato relish, haloumi <br>and rocket. <br>• Serve with rosemary potato crisps.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/693119768a52ddcac84ce3eb/step-b2d67a30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
